MULTI-TENANT ARCHITECTURE

Implement tenant-based architecture.

Every website belongs to a Company (Tenant).

Every record must belong to a company.

Examples

Company

Website

Products

Services

Orders

Categories

Media

Users

Settings

Payments

Analytics

Every table must include

company_id

Every API request must automatically determine the active company based on the request domain (Host header).

Never expose one company’s data to another.

